ngs Improvements and Agent Command Center\",\n   134→    \"description\": \"Version 2.2.1001 - Settings now open in a dedicated tab with searchable sidebar, consolidated settings gear into global activity dropdown. Added space @-mentions, automatic context sharing across sessions, model picker search improvements, and various UI/UX improvements for Agent Command Center.\",\n   135→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   136→    \"url\": \"https://windsurf.com/changelog/windsurf-next\",\n   137→    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n   138→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   139→  },\n   140→  {\n   141→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   142→    \"title\": \"Platform Default Settings, Slack Channel Override, MCP OAuth Resource Parameter\",\n   143→    \"description\": \"Org admins can set default platform (Linux/Windows) for sessions. Slack channel override via !channel command. MCP OAuth flows now forward RFC 8707 resource parameter for authentication. GitLab interactive PR review support. PR Review Status API endpoint added.\",\n   144→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   145→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n   146→    \"date\": \"2026-05-22\",\n   147→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   148→  },\n   149→  {\n   150→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   151→    \"title\": \"Collapsible Session Folders, Archive All Sessions, Default Member Roles\",\n   152→    \"description\": \"Sessions can be organized into collapsible folders. 'Archive all' option in sidebar menu. Enterprise admins can configure default roles for new organization members. GHES app registration restriction. Copyable Organization ID.\",\n   153→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   154→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n   155→    \"date\": \"2026-05-17\",\n   156→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   157→  },\n   158→  {\n   159→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   160→    \"title\": \"Snapshot Build Delete, MCP Multiline Environment Variables, Settings Redesign\",\n   161→    \"description\": \"Delete snapshot builds from build history. Multiline environment variable values for MCP servers. Settings redesigned with hub-style layout and improved search. Archive active session warning. Share session on mobile. Devin Review mobile improvements.\",\n   162→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   163→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n   164→    \"date\": \"2026-05-13\",\n   165→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   166→  },\n   167→  {\n   168→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   169→    \"title\": \"Devin Review API, Mermaid Diagram Rendering, Per-PR Auto-Review Toggle\",\n   170→    \"description\": \"Devin Review can be triggered programmatically via REST API. Mermaid code blocks render as interactive SVG diagrams. Per-PR auto-review toggle. Sidebar session notifications with persistent status labels and read/unread indicators.\",\n   171→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   172→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n   173→    \"date\": \"2026-05-08\",\n   174→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   175→  },\n   176→  {\n   177→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   178→    \"title\": \"Stacked Review Permissions, Skill Slash Commands, Auto-Fix Includes CI Checks\",\n   179→    \"description\": \"Enterprise admins can assign tiered PR Review access levels. Skills can be invoked by typing /name. Auto-fix button now includes failing CI check names. Session origin field in v3 API. Higher-quality Wiki v2 with stronger reasoning.\",\n   180→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   181→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n   182→    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n   183→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   184→  },\n   185→  {\n   186→    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n   187→    \"title\": \"Revamped Blueprint Authoring, Enterprise Commit Email Lock, PR Auto-Close Removed\",\n   188→    \"description\": \"Blueprint editor redesigned with shared layout and per-section play buttons. Enterprise admins can require commits use user's primary email. PRs no longer auto-close when session ends. Hybrid comment mode in Devin Review.\",\n   189→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   190→    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n   191→    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n   192→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   193→  },\n   194→  {\n   195→    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n   196→    \"title\": \"Search Across Conversation History\",\n   197→    \"description\": \"Codex CLI 0.134.0 - Added search across conversation history with /search command. Profile selector improvements for easier model switching. Enhanced MCP setup with better error messages and validation.\",\n   198→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   199→    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n   200→    \"date\": \"2026-05-26\",\n   201→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   202→  },\n   203→  {\n   204→    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n   205→    \"title\": \"Appshots, Goal Mode, Remote Computer Use\",\n   206→    \"description\": \"May 21, 2026 update introduced Appshots for saving application states, Goal Mode for persistent multi-step tasks, and Remote Computer Use capabilities for controlling remote machines.\",\n   207→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   208→    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n   209→    \"date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n   210→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   211→  },\n   212→  {\n   213→    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n   214→    \"title\": \"Mobile App Connections\",\n   215→    \"description\": \"May 14, 2026 update added ability to connect and use Codex CLI from mobile devices with improved cross-platform synchronization.\",\n   216→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   217→    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n   218→    \"date\": \"2026-05-14\",\n   219→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   220→  },\n   221→  {\n   222→    \"productName\": \"Gemini CLI\",\n   223→    \"title\": \"Surgical Code Edits and Session Portability\",\n   224→    \"description\": \"Gemini CLI v0.43.0 (May 22, 2026) - Surgical Code Edits feature for precise code modifications. Session Portability allows export/import of sessions. Adaptive Token Estimation for better token usage prediction. Improved UI Rendering and Enhanced Agent Architecture.\",\n   225→    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n   226→    \"url\": \"https://geminicli.com/docs/changelogs/latest/\",\n   227→    \"date\": \"2026-05-22\",\n   228→    \"community_feedback\": []\n   229→  }\n   230→]\n   231→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"
