Fix Includes CI Checks\",\n    \"description\": \"Enterprise admins can assign tiered PR Review access levels. Skills can be invoked by typing /name. Auto-fix button now includes failing CI check names. Session origin field in v3 API. Higher-quality Wiki v2 with stronger reasoning.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-06\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Devin\",\n    \"title\": \"Revamped Blueprint Authoring, Enterprise Commit Email Lock, PR Auto-Close Removed\",\n    \"description\": \"Blueprint editor redesigned with shared layout and per-section play buttons. Enterprise admins can require commits use user's primary email. PRs no longer auto-close when session ends. Hybrid comment mode in Devin Review.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://docs.devin.ai/release-notes/overview\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-01\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Search Across Conversation History\",\n    \"description\": \"Codex CLI 0.134.0 - Added search across conversation history with /search command. Profile selector improvements for easier model switching. Enhanced MCP setup with better error messages and validation.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-26\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \"productName\": \"Codex CLI\",\n    \"title\": \"Appshots, Goal Mode, Remote Computer Use\",\n    \"description\": \"May 21, 2026 update introduced Appshots for saving application states, Goal Mode for persistent multi-step tasks, and Remote Computer Use capabilities for controlling remote machines.\",\n    \"updateType\": \"feature\",\n    \"url\": \"https://developers.openai.com/codex/changelog\",\n    \"date\": \"2026-05-21\",\n    \"community_feedback\": []\n  },\n  {\n    \