lass=\"topic-tag\">ai</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">github</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">quality</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/may/22/memory-shortage/\" class=\"accent-link\">Memory shortage repricing electronics</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                        AI growth pushing HBM from 2% to 20% of allocation by end of 2026. A single GB of HBM consumes 3x more wafer capacity than DDR/LPDDR, constraining consumer RAM production.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n                        <span class=\"insight-author\">Simon Willison</span> •\n                        <span class=\"insight-source\">Blog</span> •\n                        <span>2026-05-22</span>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-topics\">\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">memory</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">hardware</span>\n                        <span class=\"topic-tag\">pricing</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"insight-item\">\n                    <div class=\"insight-title\">\n                        <a href=\"https://simonwillison.net/2026/may/22/ftc-active-listening/\" class=\"accent-link\">FTC settles 'active listening' charges</a>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-description\">\n                        FTC required Cox Media Group and two other firms to pay nearly $1M for deceiving customers about 'active listening' AI-powered marketing. Service did not actually listen to conversations.\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"insight-meta\">\n      